> 很讨厌 React 新文档中移除了这些非常有用的概念。

https://legacy.reactjs.org/docs/render-props.html

```js
function Mouse({ children }) {
  return children(mouse)
}

<Mouse>
  {mouse => (
    <p>The mouse position is {mouse.x}, {mouse.y}</p>
  )}
</Mouse>
```